WEBVTT

00:02.350 --> 00:04.570
<i>In order to protect my clan and my friends,</i>

00:05.100 --> 00:09.060
<i>I will conquer the Keild Labyrinth.</i>

00:13.120 --> 00:14.020
Rud.

00:15.160 --> 00:16.280
Lily?

00:16.710 --> 00:18.410
I have a request.

00:20.440 --> 00:22.080
Ow.

00:22.080 --> 00:23.680
What's gotten into you?

00:41.060 --> 00:50.900
<b>The Strongest Tank's Labyrinth Raids</b>

00:41.060 --> 00:50.900
<b>Labyrinth Raids</b>

00:41.060 --> 00:50.900
m 124 277 l 134 267 140 274 144 272 150 275 163 260 177 271 472 271 488 261 502 275 507 270 510 274 518 267 528 277 516 288 526 298 517 306 510 299 506 304 500 299 489 312 473 302 178 302 163 313 150 300 146 303 140 299 134 306 125 297 134 287

00:41.060 --> 00:50.900
A Tank with a Rare 9,999 Resistance Skill 
Got Kicked from the Hero's Party

02:04.390 --> 02:08.240
I can't tie the strings in the back!
 Please help me!

02:13.340 --> 02:14.780
There. All done.

02:17.100 --> 02:18.740
Thank you.

02:19.120 --> 02:22.580
Now I can surprise
 my sister with some tea.

02:23.570 --> 02:25.540
I see. Well, I'd better head back.

02:25.960 --> 02:27.260
Wait.

02:27.920 --> 02:30.390
There's something I'd like to ask you, too.

02:32.880 --> 02:39.110
You're going to be a clan leader 
from now on, aren't you?

02:39.110 --> 02:40.680
Yeah, that's right.

02:41.180 --> 02:46.060
I think it's amazing. I was impressed when 
you stated your intentions at the ball, too.

02:46.480 --> 02:51.520
After all, I'm too weak to 
tell anyone what I want to do.

02:52.210 --> 02:53.980
Is there something you want to do?

02:54.400 --> 02:56.280
Promise you won't laugh?

02:56.280 --> 02:57.110
Sure.

02:57.680 --> 03:01.260
It's not a grand goal like yours.

03:01.260 --> 03:05.580
I just don't want to impose 
on my sister forever.

03:06.140 --> 03:09.540
I want to learn to support myself.

03:10.210 --> 03:13.460
When my sister's around, 
I never have to worry about anything.

03:14.110 --> 03:18.160
I've been a fool since I was a child,
 always making mistakes.

03:18.160 --> 03:21.250
But my sister always protected me.

03:21.250 --> 03:25.690
She's perfect and capable of anything.

03:25.690 --> 03:27.770
The same is true when we fight.

03:27.770 --> 03:31.350
All I'm ever able to do is
 support her from behind.

03:31.850 --> 03:34.690
Isn't that because you're skilled at magic?

03:34.690 --> 03:38.610
My sister can use magic, too, 
but she fights at close range.

03:38.610 --> 03:43.410
And when we fuse, my sister is 
always the primary personality.

03:44.030 --> 03:48.330
I've never fought by myself before.

03:48.720 --> 03:54.290
Is that right? I always wondered 
who was in charge of your shared body.

03:54.560 --> 03:57.800
But I can't impose on her forever.

03:57.800 --> 04:01.540
I want to take care of myself.

04:01.540 --> 04:05.760
<i>I see. So that's why 
she suddenly wanted to talk to me.</i>

04:06.010 --> 04:10.980
<i>She and her sis are close. I see why it'd be hard
 to tell her she wants to be more independent.</i>

04:13.310 --> 04:16.850
Lily, you can cause me 
all the trouble you want.

04:16.850 --> 04:19.650
Give what you want to do a shot.

04:20.390 --> 04:21.400
You mean it?

04:22.250 --> 04:26.040
Then, I'll ask for your help the next time I—

04:29.540 --> 04:32.750
Lily, I thought I heard Rud's voice.

04:36.530 --> 04:38.250
Oh, sis.

04:39.080 --> 04:41.670
Rud?

04:40.210 --> 04:41.670
No, Lilia!

04:41.670 --> 04:44.210
It's not what it looks like!
 It was an accident!

04:47.520 --> 04:50.660
Could you come up to the roof with me?

04:55.100 --> 04:57.970
<i>Is she going to push me off?</i>

04:57.970 --> 04:59.520
Why are you being so cautious?

05:00.630 --> 05:04.590
It's fine. If it was anyone else, 
I would've pushed them off, though.

05:05.530 --> 05:11.910
After all, you'd never do anything to hurt
 someone's precious younger sister.

05:12.550 --> 05:16.600
I was half-pretending just then, 
so that I could get you up here.

05:20.880 --> 05:23.910
Have I ever told you about us?

05:24.710 --> 05:28.760
You mentioned your parents 
abandoned you and now you live together.

05:29.620 --> 05:36.980
Actually, it'd be more accurate to say 
we were being abused by them and ran away.

05:37.440 --> 05:40.440
Our father was especially cruel.

05:40.890 --> 05:43.200
So even if that was an accident,

05:43.200 --> 05:46.900
it's not often that she can have
a normal conversation with a man.

05:49.850 --> 05:53.830
That's part of the reason 
I wanted to talk to you, too.

05:54.700 --> 05:59.740
Someday, I'd like to take Lily to a place
 where she can truly be happy.

06:01.750 --> 06:05.960
I've decided to keep her safe until then.

06:06.830 --> 06:10.570
I see. Sounds like you two 
really love each other.

06:11.460 --> 06:15.430
Lily said you were "perfect" 
and "capable of anything."

06:15.950 --> 06:18.660
I'm not, though.

06:18.660 --> 06:22.680
That's right. I don't think 
you're perfect, either.

06:23.890 --> 06:27.830
When it comes to your sister,
 you lose your cool.

06:27.830 --> 06:30.180
You become a different person.

06:30.180 --> 06:33.000
You're the last person 
I want to hear that from.

06:39.580 --> 06:42.040
Thanks for listening.

06:42.650 --> 06:46.430
You're a dear friend. 
You can talk to me about anything.

06:47.640 --> 06:51.220
Thanks. If something comes up, I will.

06:55.910 --> 06:57.640
When's my sister coming back?

07:01.830 --> 07:04.280
Lilia and Lily, were you waiting long?

07:04.280 --> 07:05.320
It's all good.

07:05.920 --> 07:10.150
I just made it back from the 49th floor.

07:10.150 --> 07:12.130
The 49th floor?

07:10.150 --> 07:13.320
<b>Adventurers at Entrance</b>

07:12.130 --> 07:16.330
Yes. The labyrinth explorers 
escorted me there.

07:13.780 --> 07:14.700
<b>1st Floor</b>

07:13.780 --> 07:14.700
<b>45th Floor</b>

07:13.780 --> 07:14.700
<b>49th Floor</b>

